      "message": "You can\u0027t actually do a comparison like this, the R value you\u0027re comparing to is actually a bool so will always return false. What you actually want to do here is something like:\n\n    // Put this at the top of loadGlobalSettings and replace any where we have\n    // mContext.getResources() inside the function to use res instead.\n    final Resources res \u003d mContext.getResources();\n\n\n    // Set default lid/cover behaviour according to legacy device config\n    final int defaultLidBehavior;\n    if (res.getBoolean(com.android.internal.R.bool.config_lidControlsSleep)) {\n        defaultLidBehavior \u003d WindowManagerFuncs.LID_BEHAVIOR_SLEEP;\n    } else if (res.getBoolean(com.android.internal.R.bool.config_lidControlsScreenLock)) {\n        defaultLidBehavior \u003d WindowManagerFuncs.LID_BEHAVIOR_LOCK;\n    } else {\n        defaultLidBehavior \u003d WindowManagerFuncs.LID_BEHAVIOR_NONE;\n    }\n\n    loadSetting(stmt, Settings.Global.LID_BEHAVIOR, defaultLidBehavior);",
